00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.400
Module 07 · Course 3 · Prove & Show · For entrepreneurs
Brand, Identity & Image

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.800
Turn your mission, values and positioning into an identity people recognise and trust, before you launch.

3
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:30.985
This module turns your mission, values and positioning into an identity people recognise and trust: a promise you can keep, a voice, a naming logic, visual basics, simple guidelines and signs of credibility. It answers: what should people expect from us?

4
00:00:31.385 --> 00:00:31.985
Why brand matters when new

5
00:00:31.985 --> 00:00:38.400
1. With no track record yet, people judge you on how you present yourself.

6
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:44.815
2. A promise you can keep builds trust; one you cannot keep destroys it.

7
00:00:44.815 --> 00:00:51.489
3. Simple rules set now keep things consistent once others create materials.

8
00:00:51.889 --> 00:01:01.139
What you will work through: 7.1 Brand, marketing and communications · 7.2 Brand strategy and promise · 7.3 Brand personality, voice and tone · 7.4 Naming and brand architecture · 7.5 Visual identity · 7.6 Brand guidelines · 7.7 Credibility and trust signals · 7.8 Brand consistency and governance · 7.9 Recap: Brand, Identity & Image

9
00:01:01.539 --> 00:01:02.139
What you will have

10
00:01:02.139 --> 00:01:07.813
1. A brand platform with a promise that fits your current size.

11
00:01:07.813 --> 00:01:14.228
2. A voice drawn from your values and a naming logic that can grow.

12
00:01:14.228 --> 00:01:20.902
3. Visual basics, short guidelines and a plan to show trust signals.

13
00:01:21.302 --> 00:01:21.902
Practical tips

14
00:01:21.902 --> 00:01:27.946
1. You can start before a finished logo; consistency matters more than polish.

15
00:01:27.946 --> 00:01:34.361
2. Ask a few future customers or supporters which words they link with you.

16
00:01:34.361 --> 00:01:41.776
3. Watch how our example bakery turns its values into a voice people recognise.

17
